I'm building [Personal-Task-Tracker]

I am creating this ap because I want to make a app that is simple that helps users keep track of daily tasks or for work so they can see what they need to complete and what they have already completed. 

Create a task- Add task with a title and descrpiton 
View tasks- see all current tasks in one place
Complete tasks- Mark task as completed
Edit/Delete Tasks- Change or move tasks
Task status/filtering- Filter tasks by to do or complete


Tech stack: 
-React
-Flask
-PostgreSQL
-Heroku

